@startuml
!include style.puml
skinparam ArrowFontStyle plain

title Records and undo history after successful operations
state "Records: C\nUndo history: A, B" as Before
state "Records: D\nUndo history: A, B, C" as Changed
state "Records: C\nUndo history: A, B" as Undone
state "Records: E\nUndo history: A, B, C" as ChangedAgain
Before --> Changed : change C to D
Changed --> Undone : undo
Undone --> ChangedAgain : change C to E
note bottom of Changed
History is ordered oldest to newest.
Keep at most 100 previous states.
end note
note bottom of Undone
There is no redo state for D.
end note
@enduml
